flowchart TB
    Start[App Launch] --> Load{AgencyConfig\ncached locally?}
    Load -- yes --> Apply[Apply AgencyTheme + Contact + Tour]
    Load -- no --> Default[Load bundled default config]
    Apply --> Online{Connectivity\navailable?}
    Default --> Online
    Online -- yes --> Sync[Fetch latest AgencyConfig from service]
    Online -- no --> Skip[Continue with cached/default config]
    Sync --> Persist[Persist to local encrypted storage]
    Persist --> Ready[App Ready]
    Skip --> Ready

